13
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,155
A store importing ten

14
00:00:17,155 --> 00:00:18,416
thousand phone cases

15
00:00:18,416 --> 00:00:19,632
in a container pays

16
00:00:19,632 --> 00:00:21,050
